  "Description": {
    "Cost": 6550833,
    "UIName": "Kali VTOL",
    "Id": "vehicledef_Kali",
    "Name": "Kali VTOL",
    "Details": "The 30 ton Kali is designed as a heavy gunship and scout hunter. Built around a 130 rated XL engine that propels the Kali to 144kph and boasting 3.5 tons of Ferro Fibrous armour; the Kali can match speeds with the Durga and Donar Helicopters whilst carrying half a ton more armour then the Durga. A Large Pulse Laser and 4 SRM-6's with 3 tons of ammo make up the Kali's weapons. A fearsome reputation in the Clan Homeworlds and in the Inner Sphere has ensured every Clan possess at least a handful of the heavy gunships.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 9/14 hexes / 270/420 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       100     15\n<b>Left</b>          85     15\n<b>Right</b>        85     15\n<b>Rear</b>         75     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      360     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Missiles</color>",
    "Icon": "Pinto"
  },
